```javascript
if (this._o.bound) {
    removeEvent(document, 'click', this._onClick);
}
```

And in `show()`:
```javascript
if (this._o.bound) {
    addEvent(document, 'click', this._onClick);
}
```

The `_onClick` handler prevents default on clicks outside the picker. But again, not relevant to Tab.

Another thought: the `bound` option defaults to `undefined`, but the comment says "default `true` if `field` is set". In the config:
```javascript
