  field: document.getElementById('checkin'),
  ...
});
```

No `bound` option. So `opts.bound` is undefined.

But in the constructor, the picker element is inserted via `opts.field.parentNode.insertBefore(this.el, opts.field.nextSibling)` because `opts.bound` is falsy (so `else if (opts.bound)` is false, goes to `else`).

